  "tag": "moh_731_ver_2023",
  "description": "MOH 731 (Ver. July 2023) 1.3 No. Initiated on PrEP (NEW), HV01-19 to HV01-31: each client's latest Initial PrEP visit in the period where PrEP was prescribed, by population category and sex, excluding transfer-ins -- a client who transferred in had already started PrEP elsewhere, so is not newly initiated here. Pregnant and breastfeeding women (HV01-31) are counted from is_pbfw. 0 when there are none.",
